{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3735000/extras/banner_demo5.png?t=1749654483\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This free demo represents a slice of Echoes of Elysium, and we\u2019re eager to hear what you think. From refining core mechanics to expanding the world and its challenges, your feedback will help shape the game\u2019s future. Join us on this journey and let us know what resonated, what didn\u2019t, and what you'd love to see more of.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3735000/extras/bar_rough_blue.png?t=1749654483\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>ECHOES OF ELYSIUM</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dive into the enchanting world of Elysium, where ancient mechanisms coexist with serene skies and breathtaking landscapes. From towering clockwork structures to forgotten ruins, every corner of Elysium holds secrets waiting to be unearthed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3735000/extras/play_with_friends.gif?t=1749654483\" /> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>PLAY WITH FRIENDS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Uncover the mysteries of a forgotten paradise where danger lurks in the form of soul-powered clockwork beasts. Gather, craft, survive, and grow in power as you fight for survival and across a fractured landscape of diverse environments. Harvest unique resources to craft vital tools, contraptions, and airships, all aiding in your defense and exploration.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3735000/extras/build_airships_5.gif?t=1749654483\" /><strong>BUILD AIRSHIPS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Work alone or with up to 5 friends to build your fleet of airships. Airships are more than just transportation, they are an integral part of the core survival experience, serving as your main base of operations and fulfilling roles that aid in gathering and transporting raw materials, exploring new regions, and elevating play to new heights. Customize your airships, forge your destiny, and unravel the mysteries of Elysium in this unforgettable open-world RPG crafting game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3735000/extras/defeat_the_armada_2.gif?t=1749654483\" />  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>DEFEAT THE ARMADA</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fight to survive against a myriad of airborne enemies! Echoes of Elysium offers a unique airship survival experience that combines RPG, exploration, and creation in a beautifully crafted clockwork world. Level up, gain new abilities, and craft new gear to grow even more powerful. Guided by the Goddess Lethe, can you save Elysium from its doom? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>ABOUT LORIC GAMES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3735000/extras/banner_loric.png?t=1749654483\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">At Loric Games, we're passionate about creating immersive co-op RPG experiences that captivate audiences worldwide. Headquartered in Arlington, Virginia, we're committed to pushing the boundaries of innovation and storytelling in the gaming industry.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3735000/extras/bar_rough_blue.png?t=1749654483\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3735000?t=1749654483","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3735000/4eab10ef494c908212d019dfed298144cc1380e4/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1749654483","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3735000/03b841244bd735cf067acfe1d77570245a9454a7/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1749654483","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3735000/03b841244bd735cf067acfe1d77570245a9454a7/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1749654483","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3735000/extras/banner_demo5.png?t=1749654483\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This free demo represents a slice of Echoes of Elysium, and we\u2019re eager to hear what you think. From refining core mechanics to expanding the world and its challenges, your feedback will help shape the game\u2019s future. Join us on this journey and let us know what resonated, what didn\u2019t, and what you'd love to see more of.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3735000/extras/bar_rough_blue.png?t=1749654483\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>ECHOES OF ELYSIUM</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dive into the enchanting world of Elysium, where ancient mechanisms coexist with serene skies and breathtaking landscapes. From towering clockwork structures to forgotten ruins, every corner of Elysium holds secrets waiting to be unearthed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3735000/extras/play_with_friends.gif?t=1749654483\" /> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>PLAY WITH FRIENDS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Uncover the mysteries of a forgotten paradise where danger lurks in the form of soul-powered clockwork beasts. Gather, craft, survive, and grow in power as you fight for survival and across a fractured landscape of diverse environments. Harvest unique resources to craft vital tools, contraptions, and airships, all aiding in your defense and exploration.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3735000/extras/build_airships_5.gif?t=1749654483\" /><strong>BUILD AIRSHIPS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Work alone or with up to 5 friends to build your fleet of airships. Airships are more than just transportation, they are an integral part of the core survival experience, serving as your main base of operations and fulfilling roles that aid in gathering and transporting raw materials, exploring new regions, and elevating play to new heights. Customize your airships, forge your destiny, and unravel the mysteries of Elysium in this unforgettable open-world RPG crafting game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3735000/extras/defeat_the_armada_2.gif?t=1749654483\" />  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>DEFEAT THE ARMADA</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fight to survive against a myriad of airborne enemies! Echoes of Elysium offers a unique airship survival experience that combines RPG, exploration, and creation in a beautifully crafted clockwork world. Level up, gain new abilities, and craft new gear to grow even more powerful. Guided by the Goddess Lethe, can you save Elysium from its doom? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>ABOUT LORIC GAMES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3735000/extras/banner_loric.png?t=1749654483\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">At Loric Games, we're passionate about creating immersive co-op RPG experiences that captivate audiences worldwide. Headquartered in Arlington, Virginia, we're committed to pushing the boundaries of innovation and storytelling in the gaming industry.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3735000/extras/bar_rough_blue.png?t=1749654483\" /></p>","developers":["Loric Games, Inc."],"fullgame":{"appid":"2644050","name":"Echoes of Elysium"},"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3735000/be0a50ee37a0b86d38a59b634d67c1e5dacc4caa/header.jpg?t=1749654483","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257155105,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/